901","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":184,"impression_count":21475,"like_count":129,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":30},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114375050971296135","type":"quoted"}],"text":"哈佛大学图书馆的馆藏里有一盘拉德克利夫研究所研讨会的录音，可以公开收听。演讲人是张爱玲，用英文讲中文翻译，主持人报的题目是「一种文化影响的载体」。目录没有标日期，从录音里提到的日期和二手资料推断是 1969 年前后。\n\n这一版先用 3 分钟讲背景。她 1920 年生在上海，去香港读过书，1940 https://t.co/w5UmDifHRG https://t.co/e3SHaAkUMn","url":"https://x.com/dotey/status/2114907009350774901"},{"author_id":"1503362006191026180","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:24:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114906030044070312"],"id":"2114906030044070312","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9667,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2074060785513533920","type":"quoted"}],"text":"黄金矿工 0x32f…2eD48 时隔三个月再次补仓，自 2026.07 以来已累计囤积价值 1863 万美的 ethereum:0x68749665ff8d2d112fa859aa293f07a622782f38 ⛏️\n\n3 小时前他从 #Bitfinex 提出 300 XAUT（约 120 万美元），本次补仓后这 4500 枚的成本降至 $4141.54，现浮亏 60.6 万美元\n\n钱包地址 https://t.co/L6IHQhVMH3 https://t.co/iBLov2WVlL","url":"https://x.com/ai_9684xtpa/status/2114906030044070312"},{"author_id":"825183199198212096","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:21:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114905230492275087"],"id":"2114905230492275087","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6299,"like_count":24,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114326670035603612","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这几日 BNB Chain 好像在疯狂发力，市场不稳定的时候大力建设也是一件很好的事情，这类资产应该重点关注！\n\n短短一个月的时间BNB 经历了什么？\n\n1️⃣ 富途支持BNB充提币 ；\n2️⃣ BNB Chain计划推出全新高性能 L1；\n3️⃣ 纳斯达克上市公司BNC更名并敲钟仪式；\n\n我想大家应该至少放进观察 List Binance https://t.co/XsyvSlmMvG","url":"https://x.com/Bitwux/status/2114905230492275087"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114904919085899979"],"id":"2114904919085899979","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":75,"impression_count":80673,"like_count":297,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":31},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113545963935584643","type":"quoted"}],"text":"“一条河隔开的两种北京：从《流浪北京》到马驹桥”\n10月26日，有网友撰文对比北京马驹桥零工市场与一河之隔的亦庄产业园区。\n马驹桥的打工者每天凌晨挤上面包车，人货混装，跑一趟5小时挣180元；干完活回到住处，那可能是间用厨房改的宿舍，地上脏乱，墙大小便随处可见。 https://t.co/ssMzV0ZmLl https://t.co/8BGuLcE8H3","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114904919085899979"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114904918263742839"],"id":"2114904918263742839","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":147,"impression_count":179630,"like_count":867,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":43,"retweet_count":43},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114678426019803351","type":"quoted"}],"text":"“此地无银三百两”\n10月24日，有网友发现“中国没有8964这个列车编号，遇到会直接跳到8965。”\n图片显示，在列车时刻查询软件中搜索“G”和“C”开头的列车的时候，分别可以查到G8961、G8962、G8965等车次，以及C8963、C8965等车次，却没有出现编号为G8964或C8964的列车。 https://t.co/zObd7vdG83 https://t.co/lbsUdjUWTg","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114904918263742839"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114904918129627544"],"id":"2114904918129627544","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":9498,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"｜娱乐圈🍉大瓜｜\n\n某著名F姓导演早就离婚了，净身出户\n\n现投靠三姐家里，几套房子都留给了老婆\n\n反正无儿无女，她老婆有没有老公也无所谓","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114904918129627544"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:18:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114904596887830776"],"id":"2114904596887830776","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":17320,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"拜仁慕尼黑（Bayern Munich）和英格兰前锋凯恩（Kane）星期二（10月27日）终于圆梦，夺得足球界最高个人荣誉——金球奖，成为25年来首名赢得这项殊荣的英格兰球员。 https://t.co/PhYANqO7bc","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2114904596887830776"},{"author_id":"1416680666184306689","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:18:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114904588671435149"],"id":"2114904588671435149","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2725,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Anthropic 上市后，@AnthropicAI 和 @ClaudeAI 发的推可能算\"重大信息披露\"！\n\nAnthropic 周一公开了 IPO 招股书，计划以代码 ANT 在纳斯达克上市。招股书写到，上市后公司发布重大信息的渠道，除了 SEC 文件、官网和新闻稿，还包括它在 @X 上的两个账号 @AnthropicAI 和 @ClaudeAI，以及 https://t.co/h0k4kxjm5o","url":"https://x.com/PANewsCN/status/2114904588671435149"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:11:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114902886736150763"],"id":"2114902886736150763","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":11163,"like_count":31,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":3},"text":"不仅清华有智障数学教授，北大也有智障数学教授，迷信AI有过之而无不及：“人类会面对无数AI生成的文本，其中充斥着海量我们无法理解的数学概念和数学证明。在我看来，这些尚未被人类理解的内容，不属于人类智识的范畴，而应当被看作物质世界的一部分。”人类无法理解的数学证明只能是错误的而且无价值的 https://t.co/UKGEy3sdL8","url":"https://x.com/fangshimin/status/2114902886736150763"},{"author_id":"6690032","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:11:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114902671471841345"],"id":"2114902671471841345","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":35,"impression_count":6114,"like_count":39,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":5},"text":"我的 Obsidian 插件 Qiaomu Reader 下载安装已超 8k。\n\n给 Github 仓库地址，让 Renoise MCP 生成产品宣传视频。\n\n相比纯代码生成，视觉效果好点，但参考截图生成，跟真实产品稍微有点不一样。\n\n下载地址见评论区 https://t.co/uytjF0nXKO","url":"https://x.com/vista8/status/2114902671471841345"},{"author_id":"1338075202798809089","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:07:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114901741183619102"],"id":"2114901741183619102","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":23,"impression_count":43256,"like_count":57,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":12},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110504747870699656","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Anthropic招股书值得关注的几个点：1、营收体量及增速：24年全年3亿多美金营收，25年45亿美金，今年上半年162亿美金，之前在投资人闭门路演上已经公布了三季度营收168亿美金，那么26年前三季度已经实现330亿美金收入，四季度营收环比三季度还要增长。意味着26年全年Anthropic营收至少是在500~600亿美金 https://t.co/noY9urbUiy","url":"https://x.com/qinbafrank/statu